# <VERS>VERSION: 0.1.1</VERS>
# <WCTX>Diagnose the inaccessible Linux 6.12 boot without a serial console.</WCTX>
# <CLOG>Keep the UBI attachment wrapper available for built-in and modular UBI while adding boot LED checkpoints.</CLOG>

